    "description": {
      "value": "This +1 striking frost katana is always cool to the touch, nearly uncomfortably so. Unadorned and with no tsuba, its honed blade is carved from a single tusk of dragon-turtle ivory and wrapped in strips of winter wolf hide. Strikes with the katana gain a +2 status bonus to damage rolls against creatures that have a status penalty to their Speed or are slowed. The status bonus increases to +3 if the weapon has a greater striking rune and +4 for major striking.\n\n- **Activate:** Free Action\n- **Traits:** evocation, magical, cold\n- **Frequency:** once per minute\n- **Trigger:** Your spell deals cold damage to a creature\n\nChoose one creature dealt cold damage by the spell. It takes a \u20135-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 1 round."
    },
